{"html":"<!doctype html>\r\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\r\n  <head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\r\n    <title>RC1 记忆与项目规则关闭后的严格复测</title>\r\n    <style>\r\n      :root {\r\n        color-scheme: light;\r\n        --paper: #ffffff;\r\n        --canvas: #f3f1ec;\r\n        --ink: #191817;\r\n        --muted: #69645d;\r\n        --line: #cbc6bc;\r\n        --grid: #e8e4dc;\r\n        --native: #176b87;\r\n        --pass: #28745c;\r\n        --warn: #a5642b;\r\n        --paper-font: \"Times New Roman\", SimSun, \"Songti SC\",\r\n          \"Noto Serif CJK SC\", \"Source Han Serif SC\", serif;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      * {\r\n        box-sizing: border-box;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      html {\r\n        background: var(--canvas);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      body {\r\n        margin: 0;\r\n        background: var(--canvas);\r\n        color: var(--ink);\r\n        font: 15px/1.55 var(--paper-font);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      main {\r\n        width: min(1040px, calc(100vw - 40px));\r\n        margin: 20px auto 52px;\r\n        padding: 52px 62px 64px;\r\n        background: var(--paper);\r\n        border: 1px solid #ddd8cf;\r\n        border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      header {\r\n        max-width: 860px;\r\n        margin: 0 auto 34px;\r\n        text-align: center;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .kicker {\r\n        margin: 0 0 12px;\r\n        color: var(--muted);\r\n        font-size: 11px;\r\n        font-weight: 700;\r\n        letter-spacing: 0.14em;\r\n        text-transform: uppercase;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      h1 {\r\n        margin: 0;\r\n        font-size: clamp(30px, 4.8vw, 48px);\r\n        line-height: 1.12;\r\n        letter-spacing: -0.025em;\r\n        text-wrap: balance;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .dek {\r\n        max-width: 760px;\r\n        margin: 20px auto 0;\r\n        color: var(--muted);\r\n        font-size: 16px;\r\n        text-wrap: pretty;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .meta {\r\n        display: flex;\r\n        flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n        justify-content: center;\r\n        gap: 8px 18px;\r\n        margin-top: 20px;\r\n        color: var(--muted);\r\n        font-size: 12px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      section {\r\n        margin-top: 36px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      h2 {\r\n        margin: 0 0 18px;\r\n        padding-bottom: 7px;\r\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);\r\n        font-size: 18px;\r\n        line-height: 1.25;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      h3 {\r\n        margin: 0 0 5px;\r\n        font-size: 15px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      p {\r\n        margin: 0 0 14px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      code {\r\n        padding: 0.08rem 0.24rem;\r\n        background: #f2f0eb;\r\n        font: 0.92em/1.4 var(--paper-font);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .metric-grid {\r\n        display: grid;\r\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));\r\n        border-top: 1.5px solid var(--ink);\r\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .metric {\r\n        min-width: 0;\r\n        padding: 18px 16px 16px;\r\n        border-right: 1px solid var(--grid);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .metric:last-child {\r\n        border-right: 0;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .metric-label {\r\n        min-height: 36px;\r\n        color: var(--muted);\r\n        font-size: 12px;\r\n        line-height: 1.35;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .metric-value {\r\n        display: block;\r\n        margin-top: 7px;\r\n        color: var(--native);\r\n        font-size: clamp(25px, 3vw, 34px);\r\n        font-weight: 700;\r\n        line-height: 1;\r\n        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .metric-context {\r\n        display: block;\r\n        margin-top: 7px;\r\n        color: var(--muted);\r\n        font-size: 11px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .table-scroll {\r\n        overflow-x: auto;\r\n        border-top: 1.5px solid var(--ink);\r\n        border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--ink);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      table {\r\n        width: 100%;\r\n        border-collapse: collapse;\r\n        font-size: 12.5px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      th,\r\n      td {\r\n        padding: 8px 10px;\r\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grid);\r\n        text-align: left;\r\n        vertical-align: middle;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      th {\r\n        border-bottom: 1.25px solid var(--ink);\r\n        font-weight: 700;\r\n        white-space: nowrap;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      td.number,\r\n      th.number {\r\n        text-align: center;\r\n        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      tbody tr:last-child td {\r\n        border-bottom: 0;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .score {\r\n        display: inline-flex;\r\n        min-width: 58px;\r\n        justify-content: center;\r\n        padding: 3px 8px;\r\n        color: white;\r\n        background: var(--pass);\r\n        font: 700 11px/1.4 var(--paper-font);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .score.partial {\r\n        background: var(--warn);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .method-grid {\r\n        display: grid;\r\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\r\n        border-top: 1.5px solid var(--ink);\r\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .method-item {\r\n        padding: 15px 18px;\r\n        border-right: 1px solid var(--grid);\r\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grid);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .method-item:nth-child(2n) {\r\n        border-right: 0;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .method-item:nth-last-child(-n + 2) {\r\n        border-bottom: 0;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .method-item p {\r\n        margin: 0;\r\n        color: var(--muted);\r\n        font-size: 12.5px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .callout {\r\n        margin-top: 24px;\r\n        padding: 18px 20px;\r\n        background: #f4f2ed;\r\n        border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);\r\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .callout strong {\r\n        display: block;\r\n        margin-bottom: 5px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .callout p {\r\n        margin: 0;\r\n        color: #44413d;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      @media (max-width: 760px) {\r\n        main {\r\n          width: 100%;\r\n          margin: 0;\r\n          padding: 30px 20px 42px;\r\n          border-right: 0;\r\n          border-left: 0;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .metric-grid,\r\n        .method-grid {\r\n          grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .metric:nth-child(2),\r\n        .method-item:nth-child(2n) {\r\n          border-right: 0;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .metric:nth-child(-n + 2),\r\n        .method-item:nth-child(-n + 2) {\r\n          border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grid);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .method-item:nth-last-child(-n + 2) {\r\n          border-bottom: 0;\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n    </style>\r\n  </head>\r\n  <body>\r\n    <main>\r\n      <header>\r\n        <p class=\"kicker\">Comet Eval · Strict Follow-up</p>\r\n        <h1>RC1 记忆与项目规则关闭后的严格复测</h1>\r\n        <p class=\"dek\">固定主模型、关闭记忆读写和项目规则插件后的单任务复测。该结果是 RC1-on 的校正参考，不替代 16 个任务的主实验。</p>\r\n        <div class=\"meta\">\r\n          <span>Experiment · 2026-08-28 17:19</span>\r\n          <span>Task · comet-full-workflow</span>\r\n          <span>Sample · 1 run</span>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </header>\r\n\r\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"headline\">\r\n        <h2 id=\"headline\">核心数据</h2>\r\n        <div class=\"metric-grid\">\r\n          <article class=\"metric\">\r\n            <div class=\"metric-label\">总 Token（含缓存读取）</div>\r\n            <span class=\"metric-value\">−8.35%</span>\r\n            <span class=\"metric-context\">5,013,871 vs RC1-on 平均 5,470,512</span>\r\n          </article>\r\n          <article class=\"metric\">\r\n            <div class=\"metric-label\">模型成本</div>\r\n            <span class=\"metric-value\">−5.88%</span>\r\n            <span class=\"metric-context\">$4.4721 vs $4.7515</span>\r\n          </article>\r\n          <article class=\"metric\">\r\n            <div class=\"metric-label\">累计模型耗时</div>\r\n            <span class=\"metric-value\">−15.04%</span>\r\n            <span class=\"metric-context\">492.341s vs 579.491s</span>\r\n          </article>\r\n          <article class=\"metric\">\r\n            <div class=\"metric-label\">确定性检查</div>\r\n            <span class=\"metric-value\">18/18</span>\r\n            <span class=\"metric-context\">业务基线 6/6 通过</span>\r\n          </article>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"comparison\">\r\n        <h2 id=\"comparison\">RC1-on 与 RC1-off</h2>\r\n        <div class=\"table-scroll\">\r\n          <table>\r\n            <thead>\r\n              <tr>\r\n                <th>指标</th>\r\n                <th class=\"number\">RC1-on 平均</th>\r\n                <th class=\"number\">RC1-off</th>\r\n                <th class=\"number\">变化</th>\r\n              </tr>\r\n            </thead>\r\n            <tbody>\r\n              <tr><td>Agent 轮次</td><td class=\"number\">92.00</td><td class=\"number\">91</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">−1.09%</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>工具调用</td><td class=\"number\">118.00</td><td class=\"number\">118</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">0.00%</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>非缓存输入 Token</td><td class=\"number\">75,644</td><td class=\"number\">79,670</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score partial\">+5.32%</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>输出 Token</td><td class=\"number\">45,193</td><td class=\"number\">39,737</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">−12.07%</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>缓存读取 Token</td><td class=\"number\">5,349,675</td><td class=\"number\">4,894,464</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">−8.51%</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>总 Token（含缓存读取）</td><td class=\"number\">5,470,512</td><td class=\"number\">5,013,871</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">−8.35%</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>模型成本</td><td class=\"number\">$4.7515</td><td class=\"number\">$4.4721</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">−5.88%</span></td></tr>\r\n              <tr><td>累计模型耗时</td><td class=\"number\">579.491s</td><td class=\"number\">492.341s</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">−15.04%</span></td></tr>\r\n            </tbody>\r\n          </table>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <p class=\"dek\">RC1-on 数值为同一任务 3 个有效 RC1 样本的平均值；RC1-off 只有 1 个样本，因此差异只能作为方向性参考。</p>\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"controls\">\r\n        <h2 id=\"controls\">控制变量与证据</h2>\r\n        <div class=\"method-grid\">\r\n          <article class=\"method-item\"><h3>主模型</h3><p><code>deepseek-v4-flash[1m]</code>，与 RC1-on 对照一致，避免把上下文窗口规格混入 Token 差异。</p></article>\r\n          <article class=\"method-item\"><h3>记忆配置</h3><p><code>memory.learning: false</code>；<code>memory.retrieval: false</code>。</p></article>\r\n          <article class=\"method-item\"><h3>插件快照</h3><p>启动事件记录 <code>plugins: []</code>；用户级残留的 <code>comet.project-rules</code> 已禁用。</p></article>\r\n          <article class=\"method-item\"><h3>实验标识</h3><p><code>experiment_20260828_171931</code>；报告通过 18/18 checks，Judge 没有替代确定性检查。</p></article>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"callout\">\r\n          <strong>边界</strong>\r\n          <p>当前源码已经移除了 <code>comet.project-rules</code>，且本次没有加载插件，所以这次实验不能估算项目规则插件本身的因果 Token 成本。上一轮 Token 增幅来自主模型规格不一致；校正后，本样本没有显示关闭记忆和规则会增加总 Token。</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </section>\r\n    </main>\r\n  </body>\r\n</html>\r\n"}